the dashboard should have a sidebar on the left for navigating different portions.  this should match the setup of the user profile page so the layout is consistent.

User progress over time

1RM graph (by lift, over time)

Exercise trends and history

Key statistics (volume, frequency, PRs, etc.)

Include tooltips or markers if data (e.g., sets or 1RM) is estimated

Visualization Page, in the left sidebar.

Track exercise history per lift

Visualize:

Set/rep schemes across time

Rotation and variation frequency

Show estimated 1RM with explanatory tooltip when relevant

Program Management

Program Creation Flow:

Allow users to enter preferences and constraints

Use backend API to generate a tailored program

Current Program View:

Display current program details

Support viewing and interacting with today’s and this week’s workouts

Allow calendar-based workout scheduling

Support editing existing workouts if available through the backend

Show upcoming and past workouts

Show exercise rotation history

Workout Flow

Guided workout experience for each day

Pull workouts from backend

Display all sets, reps, rest, and cues

Allow marking completion and saving performance

